/**
 * @page extensions Library Extensions
 *
 * @brief Optional companion libraries and output serializers for lazybios.
 *
 * @section ext_json JSON Serialization Extension (`ext/json`)
 *
 * The `lazybios_json` extension provides cJSON-based serialization for parsed
 * SMBIOS entry points and structure tables. It converts parsed lazybios structures
 * into structured JSON trees.
 *
 * @subsection ext_json_build Building with JSON Support
 *
 * JSON serialization requires the `libcjson` library development package.
 * Enable the CMake option @c LAZYBIOS_EXT_JSON when configuring the project:
 *
 * @code{.sh}
 * cmake -S . -B build -DLAZYBIOS_EXT_JSON=ON
 * cmake --build build
 * @endcode
 *
 * @subsection ext_json_api API Overview
 *
 * - @ref lazybiosExtJSONAddSMBIOSInfo — Serializes entry point metadata and lazybios version.
 * - @ref lazybiosExtJSONAddType0 — Serializes Type 0 (BIOS Information) arrays.
 * - @ref lazybiosExtJSONAddType1 — Serializes Type 1 (System Information) arrays.
 * - @ref lazybiosExtJSONAddType2 — Serializes Type 2 (Baseboard Information) arrays.
 * - @ref lazybiosExtJSONAddType3 — Serializes Type 3 (Chassis Information) arrays.
 * - @ref lazybiosExtJSONAddType4 — Serializes Type 4 (Processor Information) arrays.
 * - @ref lazybiosExtJSONAddType5 — Serializes Type 5 (Memory Controller Information) arrays.
 * - @ref lazybiosExtJSONAddType6 — Serializes Type 6 (Memory Module Information) arrays.
 * - @ref lazybiosExtJSONAddType7 — Serializes Type 7 (Cache Information) arrays.
 * - @ref lazybiosExtJSONAddType8 — Serializes Type 8 (Port Connector Information) arrays.
 * - @ref lazybiosExtJSONAddType9 — Serializes Type 9 (System Slots) arrays.
 *
 * Field status handling:
 * - `LAZYBIOS_FIELD_PRESENT` values are serialized as native JSON strings or numbers.
 * - `LAZYBIOS_FIELD_ABSENT` fields are serialized as JSON `null`.
 * - `LAZYBIOS_FIELD_UNREACHABLE` fields are serialized as the sentinel string `"N/A"`
 *   (defined by @ref LAZYBIOS_JSON_UNREACHABLE).
 *
 * @see @ref api_extensions
 */
